Maintainer: The Boo contributors <boolang@googlegroups.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/boo-lang/boo
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu70
Description: Boo programming language
 Boo is an object oriented statically typed language for the CLI, with a
 Python inspired syntax and a focus on language and compiler extensibility.
 .
 This package carries the compiler (booc), the interpreter (booi) and the
 interactive shell (booish). Each is self contained: the .NET runtime they
 need is included, so no separate runtime package is required.
